    "enUS": {
      "description": "A warrior of the Horde, Regthar Deathgate, is recruiting agents for a mission into the land of Desolace.  Speak with him if you wish to volunteer.  He is stationed in the Barrens, in a series of bunkers west of the Crossroads.\n\nAnd sharpen your weapons.  Desolace is a place torn by war.",
